{"id":"cf7dbabb97c0679f","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-finite-model-property.md","title":"Finite Model Property","display":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-finite-model-property","aliases":["89-df-finite-model-property","finite model property","有限模型性质","FMP"],"display":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-finite]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]","[[89-df-kripke-frame]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-finite-model-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-finite-model-property</span><span>finite model property</span><span>有限模型性质</span><span>FMP</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-finite-model-property-—-Finite-Model-Property-(FMP)\">df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property (FMP)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFrame}\">\\(\\mathrm{KFrame}\\)</span> is the well-formed-frame predicate from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FMP}(L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(A\\notin L\\to\n\\exists W,R\\;\n(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\n\\land\\forall B\\in L\\;((W,R)\\models B)\n\\land(W,R)\\not\\models A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FMP}(L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(A\\notin L\\to\n\\exists W,R\\;\n(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\n\\land\\forall B\\in L\\;((W,R)\\models B)\n\\land(W,R)\\not\\models A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>FMP : 有限模型性质</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> : 模态逻辑</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有限模型性质是模态逻辑的重要性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对递归可枚举且有限模型检验有效的逻辑，FMP 与有效的有限反模型搜索\n合起来可推出可判定性；FMP 单独不蕴含可判定性</li>\n<li>FMP 提供&quot;小反例&quot;的存在性</li>\n<li>FMP 是许多模态逻辑的共同特征</li>\n</ul>\n<p>FMP的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不有效公式有&quot;有限证据&quot;</li>\n<li>可以用算法寻找反模型</li>\n<li>FMP 本身不提供固定的复杂度上界</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有FMP的逻辑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>K, T, K4, S4, S5（通过过滤技术证明）</li>\n<li>GL（需要特殊证明，因为过滤可能破坏逆良基性）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>GL的特殊情况：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GL框架需要逆良基性</li>\n<li>过滤可能破坏逆良基性</li>\n<li>但GL仍有有限模型性质（需要特殊证明）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"170626a7dad88370\" href=\"?note=170626a7dad88370\" title=\"89-df-filtration\">89-df-filtration</a>：证明FMP的技术</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a>：FMP关于有效性</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a>：典范模型（通常无限）</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>：GL的特殊情况</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f4b51513503cf1c0\" href=\"?note=f4b51513503cf1c0\" title=\"89-thm-fmp-gl\">89-thm-fmp-gl</a>：GL的FMP定理</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考文献：Boolos, George. <em>The Logic of Provability</em>. Chapter 2.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-finite-model-property-—-Finite-Model-Property-(FMP)","text":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property (FMP)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embe