-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-thm-fmp-gl]]：GL的FMP定理","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FMP}(L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(A\\notin L\\to\n\\exists W,R\\;\n(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\n\\land\\forall B\\in L\\;((W,R)\\models B)\n\\land(W,R)\\not\\models A)).","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":2064,"backlinks":[{"id":"74c9df4215ffa321","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"FMP : 有限模型性质 (see [[89-df-finite-model-property]])"},{"id":"f4b51513503cf1c0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FMP}(\\mathrm{GL})$ is the predicate from\n[[89-df-finite-model-property]]."},{"id":"1b619488086561ea","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"GL具有有限模型性质 (see [[89-df-finite-model-property]])"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-realization.md]]\n[[89-df-bisimulation.md]]\n[[89-df-box-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[89-df-completeness-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[89-df-consistent-pa.md]]\n[[89-df-converse-well-founded.md]]\n[[89-df-dejongh-theorem.md]]\n[[89-df-diamond-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-filtration.md]]\n[[89-df-finite.md]]\n[[89-df-finite-model-property.md]]\n[[89-df-fixed-point-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[89-df-generated-submodel.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-algorithm.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-4.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-k.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-l-def.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-l.m